{"resourceIdentifier":"3890","resourceName":"Elmadag Biogas Power Plant","description":"Elmadag Biogas Power Plant (hereafter referred to as the Project) is a biogas-to-energy project that involves methane capture through anaerobic digestion and utilization of methane for thermal energy and electricity generation via cogeneration units. The animal manure is collected from the neighbouring animal farms with vacuum trucks and transferred to the biogas plant. Continuously Stirred Tank Reactor (CSTR) type anaerobic digesters are used to capture methane-rich biogas. Biogas is then utilized in cogeneration units for heat and electricity generation. The thermal energy is utilized for heating anaerobic fermenters. The generated electricity is both used for internal electricity requirements and supplied to the national grid.  The project is being implemented by ABRAK ENERJİ ELEKTRİK ÜRETİM ANONİM ŞİRKETİ, the Project Owner, in Elmadağ district, Ankara province, in Turkey. This project adopts the renewable crediting period of 7 years, twice renewable for a total of 21 years. The estimated average net annual emission reductions are 32,858 tCO2eq/y. Accordingly, the project is expected to generate 238,008 tCO2eq/y emissions reduction during the first crediting period.","location":{"latitude":40.037864,"longitude":33.114366},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-11-10","endExclusive":"2022-12-11","endInclusive":"2022-12-10"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3890"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Ankara"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"32858"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-I.D.,AMS-III.D."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"EcoLance Private Limited"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"13/12/2023"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 31/12/2020 - 30/12/2027"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=77154&IDKEY=aiofj09234rm9oq4jndsma80vcalksdjf98cxkjaf90823nmq3k106395366","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Description-Elmadag Biogas-v4.1-22102022.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-10-27T13:33:01.95Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=77152&IDKEY=98723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq07106392608","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS-Listing-Representation- Elmadag Biogas- v4.1-23032022.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-10-27T13:31:18.937Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=103888&IDKEY=f98klasmf8jflkasf8098afnasfkj98f0a9sfsakjflsakjf8df143261552","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Description-V4.2_Abrak Biogas(ID3890)_version03_Clean_08122023.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-12-13T15:15:44.863Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=81843&IDKEY=xiofj09234rm9oq4jndsma80vcalksdjf98cxkjaf90823nmq3o112861497","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"VCS-Registration-Representation-Elmadag Biogas-ID3890-v4.1.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-12-30T16:27:02.16Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=103889&IDKEY=skjalskjf098234k